 "note": "args = [note text, options]. options (all optional) = {format, alias, kinds, window [from,to], weekly, monthly, range [firstLine,lastLine]}; the test builds the link text with a small date formatter (tests/fmt.ts) that follows moment for these formats: YYYY MM DD MMM and the en week gggg-[W]ww. expected = {text, changed: zero-based numbers of the lines that differ}. The link goes at the end of the description, before the first trailing field, because the Tasks plugin (DefaultTaskSerializer) reads fields from the end of the line, the block id first. Every expected value is written by hand, line by line.",
